{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>וימן, קיקיון</b> — The sages of Spain say: a gourd or qera. There is no need to know what it is." "<b>להציל לו מרעתו</b> — From the severity of the sun's heat. And some say: because he remained in the fish's belly a long time, the skin of his flesh was tender and he could not endure the heat."], :book :jonah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Jonah -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=19&perek=1&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:07:07.800847296Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}